      "note": "A parent-started Orchestrator forwards the Manager's matters for the Architect unchanged and sends developer questions, permission notices and one final report-path message on the same route (with no status-only messages or other landing notices), continues independent work when delivery is held or refused, and uses its own chat for developer decisions when dashboard-started without a parent.",
